  "summary": {
    "plain": "ROSEBUD's 2001 status: sub-keV thresholds on sapphire and germanium bolometers, and first tests of scintillating bolometers that tell nuclear recoils from electrons.",
    "technical": "Phase 1: 25 g and 50 g sapphire and 67 g germanium absorbers, thresholds below 1 keV and 450 eV; phase 2 prototypes of CaWO4 (54 g) and BGO (46 g) scintillating bolometers with high neutron/gamma discrimination and a 6 keV heat-channel threshold on BGO."
  },
